### Extended Catalog Finding

#### 10. Assertion Roulette  
**Affected:** `CalculateTotal_ReturnsCorrectAmount` (line 69)  
Three assertions with **no message parameters** — when one fails, MSTest reports a value mismatch but not *which* of the three amounts was wrong without reading the stack trace.

```csharp
// ❌ SMELL — 3 assertions, zero messages
Assert.AreEqual(247.50m, order.TotalAmount);
Assert.AreEqual(22.28m, order.TaxAmount);
Assert.AreEqual(269.78m, order.GrandTotal);
```

**Fix:** Add descriptive messages:

```csharp
Assert.AreEqual(expectedSubtotal, order.TotalAmount, "Subtotal mismatch");
Assert.AreEqual(expectedTax, order.TaxAmount, "Tax mismatch");
Assert.AreEqual(expectedGrand, order.GrandTotal, "Grand total mismatch");
```

**Risk if unfixed:** Failure triage takes longer — you must read the stack trace line number to identify which amount failed.

